msgid "Move up"
msgstr "Pārvietot augšup"

#: frontend/php/git/admin/index.php:164
msgid "Move down"
msgstr "Pārvietot lejup"

#: frontend/php/git/admin/index.php:170
msgid ""
"Path to a file like <code><var>branch</var>:<var>directory</var>/<var>file</var></code>.\n"
"The file will be displayed on the &ldquo;about page&rdquo;\n"
"of the repository.  Savane filter passes files with names ending in\n"
"&ldquo;.html&rdquo; unmodified; in other files, HTML special\n"
"characters are replaced with HTML entities, and the result\n"
"is enclosed in a <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> element.  For more info,\n"
"dig into cgitrc (5)."
msgstr ""
"Ceļš uz failu, piemēram, <code><var>zars</var>:<var>direktorija</var>/<var>fails</var></code>.\n"
"Fails tiks rādīts repozitorija &ldquo;par lapā&rdquo;.\n"
"Savane filtrs failus, kuru nosaukumi beidzas ar &ldquo;.html&rdquo;,\n"
"nodod nemainītus; citos failos HTML speciālās rakstzīmes tiek aizstātas\n"
"ar HTML entītijām, un rezultāts tiek ietverts elementā\n"
"<code>&lt;pre&gt;</code>. Sīkāka informācija — cgitrc (5)."

